<section class="aq-section"><div class="aq-in aq-stack-l"><header class="aq-sec-head"><h2 class="aq-h1">Three ways in</h2></header><ul class="aq-contact-routes" style="--routes:3"><li class="aq-contact-routes__route is-urgent" style="--o:1" data-theme="light"><p class="aq-contact-routes__mark"><span class="aq-contact-routes__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Urgent</p><h3 class="aq-contact-routes__t">Production stopped or water out of specification</h3><p class="aq-contact-routes__d">Severity 1. Answered <span class="aq-ph">[service phone hours]</span>. Do not wait for a form.</p><p class="aq-contact-routes__phone"><svg class="aq-contact-routes__icon" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5.5 1.5H3.5A1.5 1.5 0 0 0 2 3C2 9 7 14 13 14A1.5 1.5 0 0 0 14.5 12.5V10.5L11.5 9.5L10 11C8 10 6 8 5 6L6.5 4.5Z"></path></svg><span class="aq-contact-routes__k">Call</span><span class="aq-contact-routes__num"><span class="aq-ph">[service phone number]</span></span></p><ol class="aq-contact-routes__steps"><li><span class="aq-contact-routes__n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><span class="aq-contact-routes__s">Call the service line</span></li><li><span class="aq-contact-routes__n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><span class="aq-contact-routes__s">Triage call confirms the severity</span></li><li><span class="aq-contact-routes__n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><span class="aq-contact-routes__s">Remote diagnosis, then a technician on site</span></li></ol><p class="aq-contact-routes__clock"><svg class="aq-contact-routes__icon" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="6.5"></circle><path d="M8 4.5V8L10.5 9.5"></path></svg><span class="aq-contact-routes__k">Response</span><span class="aq-contact-routes__v">Technician on site within <span class="aq-ph">[severity 1 on-site response time, hours]</span></span></p><div class="aq-contact-routes__action"><a class="aq-btn aq-btn--secondary" href="#contact-service" data-wp="contact-service">Log a service request</a></div></li><li class="aq-contact-routes__route is-current" style="--o:0" aria-current="page"><p class="aq-contact-routes__mark">This page</p><h3 class="aq-contact-routes__t">Request a proposal or review</h3><p class="aq-contact-routes__d">New system, upgrade or document review: send your URS and water data.</p><ol class="aq-contact-routes__steps"><li><span class="aq-contact-routes__n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><span class="aq-contact-routes__s">Choose your request; send what you have</span></li><li><span class="aq-contact-routes__n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><span class="aq-contact-routes__s">An engineer reads it and replies by name</span></li><li><span class="aq-contact-routes__n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><span class="aq-contact-routes__s">Written answer, then a firm proposal</span></li></ol><p class="aq-contact-routes__clock"><svg class="aq-contact-routes__icon" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="6.5"></circle><path d="M8 4.5V8L10.5 9.5"></path></svg><span class="aq-contact-routes__k">Response</span><span class="aq-contact-routes__v">Written reply within <span class="aq-ph">[proposal response time, working days]</span></span></p><div class="aq-contact-routes__action"><a class="aq-btn aq-btn--primary" href="#contact-proposal" data-jump="intake">Choose your request <span class="aq-btn__arrow" aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div></li><li class="aq-contact-routes__route" style="--o:2"><h3 class="aq-contact-routes__t">Visit or audit the shop</h3><p class="aq-contact-routes__d">Shop tour, supplier audit or FAT witness at <span class="aq-ph">[shop location, city and province]</span>.</p><ol class="aq-contact-routes__steps"><li><span class="aq-contact-routes__n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><span class="aq-contact-routes__s">Tell us the purpose, dates and group</span></li><li><span class="aq-contact-routes__n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><span class="aq-contact-routes__s">We reply with a date and an agenda</span></li><li><span class="aq-contact-routes__n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><span class="aq-contact-routes__s">Records and test bay ready on the day</span></li></ol><p class="aq-contact-routes__clock"><svg class="aq-contact-routes__icon" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="6.5"></circle><path d="M8 4.5V8L10.5 9.5"></path></svg><span class="aq-contact-routes__k">Response</span><span class="aq-contact-routes__v">Date and agenda within <span class="aq-ph">[visit booking reply time, working days]</span></span></p><div class="aq-contact-routes__action"><a class="aq-btn aq-btn--secondary" href="#contact-locations" data-wp="contact-locations">Book a visit</a></div></li></ul></div></section>
